Background removal bundles the U²-Netp model weights from U²-Net
(Xuebin Qin et al., https://github.com/xuebinqin/U-2-Net, Apache-2.0),
converted (BatchNorm folded, half precision with per-channel
scales) to Omniweave's own format and run by
Omniweave's own code (no third-party inference runtime).

Text recognition (OCR) bundles the PP-OCRv5 mobile text detection and
Korean recognition weights by the PaddlePaddle Authors (PaddleOCR,
https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR, Apache-2.0), converted
(BatchNorm folded, 8-bit weights with per-channel scales) to Omniweave's
own format and run by Omniweave's own code; the license text ships in
models/ocr/LICENSE.

Image upscale (AI) bundles the Real-ESRGAN compact models
realesr-general-x4v3, realesr-general-wdn-x4v3 and realesr-animevideov3
(Copyright (c) 2021, Xintao Wang; https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN,
BSD 3-Clause), converted (convolution + PReLU fused, half precision /
8-bit weights) to Omniweave's own format and run by Omniweave's own code;
the license text ships in models/sr/LICENSE.

Background removal of person photos bundles the MODNet portrait matting
weights (Zhanghan Ke et al.; https://github.com/ZHKKKe/MODNet, Apache-2.0),
converted (8-bit weights with per-channel scales) to Omniweave's own format
and run by Omniweave's own code; the license text ships in
models/matte/LICENSE.

The optional high-quality background removal (PC only) downloads, when the
user first chooses it, the BiRefNet-lite weights (Copyright (c) 2024
ZhengPeng; https://github.com/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet, MIT), converted
(BatchNorm folded, 8-bit weights with per-channel scales) to Omniweave's
own format and run by Omniweave's own code; the file is not bundled and its
license text is published next to it
(https://wind2sp.github.io/omniweave/models/birefnet/LICENSE).

CMYK documents without a usable colour profile are shown through an
altered, reduced version of the FOGRA39L Coated profile from the OpenICC /
colord free profile set (Kai-Uwe Behrmann, Marti Maria, Photogamut,
Graeme Gill, ColorSolutions; zlib licence), built on the FOGRA39L
characterization data by Fogra (www.fogra.org); see
src/assets/icc/LICENSE-FOGRA39L.txt and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
